* UCC27282 behavioural model -- LOCAL VALIDATION MODEL, not the vendor model.
* Source: TI UCC27282 datasheet SNVSAQ5B (Nov 2018, revised May 2022).
*
* Implemented from the datasheet:
*   VDD UVLO          5.0 V rising / 4.5 V falling
*   HB  UVLO          3.7 V rising / 3.3 V falling, with respect to HS
*   EN threshold      2.0 V rising / 1.21 V falling
*   EN timing         T_EN 18 us, T_DIS 1.5 us
*   HI/LI thresholds  2.1 V rising / 1.1 V falling (1.0 V hysteresis)
*   propagation       TPD 16 ns typical (30 ns max), applied to both channels
*   output drive      3 A peak -> 4 ohm totem pole (HO to HB/HS, LO to VDD/VSS)
*   bstrap diode      integrated, VF 0.55 V @100 uA, ~0.9 V @80 mA, RD ~2.5 ohm
*   HB leakage        240 kohm (50 uA max at 12 V)
*   VDD quiescent     30 kohm (0.4 mA max)
*
* NOT modelled: delay matching (1/7 ns), minimum input pulse width (20 ns),
* bootstrap diode reverse recovery (50 ns), input pulldown (250 kohm, add if the
* controller cannot drive it), temperature, and the 0.1 mA HB operating current
* at 500 kHz (negligible next to the 240 kohm leakage for Cboot sizing).
*
* Hysteretic states are B current sources into R/C nodes (a B voltage source
* that reads its own node is a singular matrix in LTspice).
*
* Pin order: VDD HB HS LO HO HI LI EN VSS
*
.subckt UCC27282 VDD HB HS LO HO HI LI EN VSS
+ params: TPD=16n T_EN=18u T_DIS=1.5u

* --- enable: hysteresis, then asymmetric turn-on / turn-off delay ---
Byl   0 yl I=if(V(EN,VSS)>2.0,1m,if(V(EN,VSS)<1.21,-1m,0))
Ryl   yl 0 1k
Cyl   yl 0 10p
Ben   en_d 0 V=if(V(yl)>0.5, delay(V(yl),T_EN), delay(V(yl),T_DIS))

* --- supply and bootstrap UVLO, each with its own hysteresis ---
Buvdd 0 uvdd I=if(V(VDD,VSS)>5.0,1m,if(V(VDD,VSS)<4.5,-1m,0))
Ruvdd uvdd 0 1k
Cuvdd uvdd 0 10p
Buvhb 0 uvhb I=if(V(HB,HS)>3.7,1m,if(V(HB,HS)<3.3,-1m,0))
Ruvhb uvhb 0 1k
Cuvhb uvhb 0 10p

* --- input receivers ---
Bhil 0 hil I=if(V(HI,VSS)>2.1,1m,if(V(HI,VSS)<1.1,-1m,0))
Rhil hil 0 1k
Chil hil 0 10p
Blil 0 lil I=if(V(LI,VSS)>2.1,1m,if(V(LI,VSS)<1.1,-1m,0))
Rlil lil 0 1k
Clil lil 0 10p

* --- propagation delay, then UVLO / enable gating ---
Bhod hod 0 V=if(delay(V(hil),TPD)>0.5,if(V(uvhb)>0.5,if(V(uvdd)>0.5,if(V(en_d)>0.5,1,0),0),0),0)
Blod lod 0 V=if(delay(V(lil),TPD)>0.5,if(V(uvdd)>0.5,if(V(en_d)>0.5,1,0),0),0)
Bhn  hn  0 V=1-V(hod)
Bln  ln  0 V=1-V(lod)

* --- totem-pole outputs: 3 A peak = 12 V / 4 ohm ---
Sho_u HB  HO hod 0 SWDRV
Sho_d HO  HS hn  0 SWDRV
Slo_u VDD LO lod 0 SWDRV
Slo_d LO  VSS ln 0 SWDRV
.model SWDRV SW(Ron=4 Roff=1Meg Vt=0.5)

* --- integrated bootstrap diode ---
Dbs VDD HB DBS
.model DBS D(Is=1e-11 Rs=2.5 N=1.2 Cjo=10p)

* --- leakage and quiescent current ---
Rhbs HB HS 240k
Ridd VDD VSS 30k

.ends UCC27282
